DESCRIPTION:Join us all month long for NC April Science Festival with this 
 self-guided scavenger hunt up to Flat Rock View. Park at Boone Fork Parkin
 g Area (milepost 299.9 on the Blue Ridge Parkway)\, find the flyer by the 
 map at the start of the trailhead\, scan the QR code in the Actionbound ap
 p\, and start completing the Grandfather Mountain State Park bound! The QR
  code is also attached to this event if you'd like to scan earlier and see
  what adventure you'll be going on.\n\nThis scavenger hunt takes you up Da
 niel Boone Scout Trail to Flat Rock View\, which is 3.6 miles round trip. 
 The hike is moderately strenuous\, and climbs 1\,050 feet up to Flat Rock 
 View. \n\nThis is a self-guided hike\, please wear appropriate hiking shoe
 s and dress for the weather.\n\nThere are no bathrooms at Boone Fork Parki
 ng Area.
LOCATION:Boone Fork Parking Area\, Milepost 299.9 on the Blue Ridge Parkway
SUMMARY:Grandfather Mountain Scavenger Hunt
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/grandfather-mountain-scaveng
 er-hunt
