DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Earth Day with the Rangers at Lake James State P
 ark!\n\nJoin us for a meaningful afternoon of service and fun as we work t
 ogether to care for our park. In honor of Earth Day\, we’ll be picking u
 p litter around the Paddy’s Creek Swim Beach and nearby picnic areas to 
 help keep Lake James beautiful for everyone to enjoy.\n\nAfter our cleanup
 \, stick around for a round of “Oh\, Deer\,” an engaging and interacti
 ve game that explores wildlife survival.\n\nWe will meet at 3:30 PM in the
  Paddy’s Creek day-use area at the swim beach. All tools and personal pr
 otective equipment (PPE) will be provided. All ages are welcome to join.
GEO:35.760718;-81.882276
