DESCRIPTION:Embark on the Curious Minds Adventure Scavenger Hunt at Lake Ja
 mes State Park! Located in Burke and McDowell counties 50 miles northeast 
 of Asheville\, Lake James State Park includes two areas to access this pic
 turesque lake that are perfect for boating\, swimming\, and fishing. Camps
 ites at both Catawba River and Paddy's Creek accesses provide an opportuni
 ty to spend the night by the lake\, with some sites accessible only by pad
 dling. Trails include bike trails at Paddy's Creek\, the kid-friendly Holl
 y Discovery Trail\, the historic Overmountain Victory Trail\, and the Font
 a Flora State Trail.
