 tranding response. Join Museum Natural Science Curator Keith Rittmaster to
  learn about the biology\, behavior\, and conservation issues affecting 
 “Beaufort’s Dolphins.”\n\nThis program is part of the museum’s Mar
 itime Heritage Lecture Series\, informal lectures focused on North Carolin
 a’s rich maritime history\, coastal environment\, and culture.  Programs
  are offered select Thursdays at noon. The lectures are held in the 
 museum auditorium and streamed via Zoom. Admission is free\, and registrat
 ion is not required for the in-person program. Visit ncmaritimemuseumbeauf
 ort.com/virtual to sign up to receive the Zoom links. Programs are also po
