DESCRIPTION:2026 Service Symposium\n250 & Beyond: Our American Story\n\nA n
 ationwide celebration of service\nEvent date: April 24\, 2026 | 10am EDT\n
 \nJoin us for a FREE live broadcast from anywhere in the country of our la
 ndmark hybrid symposium\, a nationwide celebration of service.\n\nAs the n
 ation approaches its 250th anniversary\, the 2026 Service Symposium | 250 
 & Beyond: Our American Story serves as the culminating celebration of a mo
 vement launched in 2024 to honor and inspire the American spirit of servic
 e. Learn more about this movement.\n\nBy bringing together thousands of Am
 ericans—including students\, educators\, nonprofit leaders\, public serv
 ants\, and community members—we will reflect on our past\, highlight inc
 redible acts of service happening today\, and inspire the next 250 years o
 f American service.​​​\n\nWho Should Attend? \n\nThis celebration is
  for everyone! Whether you are a K-12 or higher education student\, an edu
 cator\, a volunteer\, a philanthropic partner\, or a civic leader\, this e
 vent is designed for those committed to civic engagement\, education\, and
  community impact.\n\nRead about our 2024 Service Symposium to get a taste
  of what's in store for 2026.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:250 & Beyond: Our American Story Virtual Symposium
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/250-beyond-our-american-stor
 y-virtual-symposium
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
