DESCRIPTION:Kick back\, relax\, and let us provide the soundtrack to a hang
 out with your favorite people. The iQ is partnering with NCMA Winston-Sale
 m to bring their House Hangs series outdoors to Bailey Park. Aptly renamed
  Park Hangs\, this reinvented Signature Event series features talented mus
 icians at the Bailey Park stage in the midst of the iQ’s iconic cityscap
 e. Get ready for the opportunity to enjoy music and socialize at this laid
 -back community event.  \n\nEvent Details\n\nPark Hangs will bring free li
 ve music to the iQ once a month from April through October. To make sure e
 veryone can comfortably enjoy the performance\, please plan to bring a bla
 nket to sit on or a low-backed outdoor chair. Dogs are welcome\, but they 
 must remain leashed for the duration of the event.\n\nFood and Beverage Ve
 ndors\n\nA rotating selection of food trucks and drink vendors will be at 
 all Park Hangs events. Additionally\, you’re welcome to bring your own f
 ood to the park or carry in food from one of your favorite iQ restaurants 
 during the event. Drinks from Incendiary Brewing will be available for pur
 chase\, but outside alcohol is prohibited.\n\nEvent Time\n\nEach Park Hang
 s concert will be held from 6-8 p.m. Food and drink will be available to p
 urchase starting an hour before the event. \n\nLocation\n\nParks Hangs tak
 es place on the Upper Lawn of Bailey Park\, 445 Patterson Ave. Winston-Sal
 em\, NC\n\nParking\n\nLimited street parking is available for this event\,
  with additional paid parking in the Link Parking Deck located at 530 Nort
 h Patterson Avenue.\n\nWeather Plan\n\nIn the event of inclement weather\,
  an announcement about cancellation or rescheduling will be made by 4 p.m.
  on the day of the event.
GEO:36.099537;-80.240911
LOCATION:Bailey Park\, Upper Lawn
SUMMARY:Park Hangs: Blue Cactus
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-hangs-blue-cactus
