DESCRIPTION:Join the Hammocks Beach staff as we host the NC SciFest Star Pa
 rty Event:  "Mission to the Moon".  This is an after hours event filled wi
 th a variety of hands-on space-themed activities for all ages. Families ca
 n build and test their own Moon landing modules\, launch stomp rockets\, a
 nd construct creative Moon bases while learning about engineering and life
  in space. Visitors can explore the night sky through telescopes\, listen 
 to cultural sky stories during Storytelling Under the Stars\, and try chal
 lenges like the Rover Maze\, Lunar Twister\, and Lunar Bean Bag Toss. Addi
 tional rotating activities from NC SciFest offer quick STEM experiences th
 roughout the event. Together\, these stations blend science\, imagination\
 , and exploration to inspire curiosity about our universe.
GEO:34.670531;-77.143056
