 th viewing. Please call the visitor center a few days prior for updates. R
 egistration is not required.  \n\nFriday\, April 24th and 25th \n\nSolar V
 iewing: 10 am to 12 pm (only on 25th)\n\nNighttime Viewing: 8:00 pm to 9:0
