DESCRIPTION:Join us on a "Mission to the Moon\," with hands-on activities a
 nd night-sky viewing in beautiful Bertie County! We'll meet at Bertie Beac
 h on the Chowan River\, which features a large open field with an expansiv
 e view of the night sky. Start off with some hands-on activities to learn 
 about the Moon while we wait for dark\, and then we will look at the sky t
 hrough telescopes.\n\nSeveral community partners will be participating as 
 well\, including members of local astronomy clubs.
GEO:36.031955;-76.724573
LOCATION:Bertie Beach
