DESCRIPTION:We all huddled inside through a cold winter\, but how did the t
 urtles stay warm during the snow and ice? Learn all about turtle superpowe
 rs that help them survive the winter months!\n\nAll children must be accom
 panied by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\
 , wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSpaces are limited\, and registr
 ation is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncp
 arks.gov. Include the number of guests in your party and a phone number wh
 ere you can be reached if the event is changed or canceled.
