 :00 PM at the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources in Raleigh
 .\n\nThe meeting will include remarks from department leadership\, present
 ations on education and public history initiatives\, updates from Commissi
 oners\, and discussion of Commission business.\n\nThe Commission advises a
 nd assists the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources in the pr
 eservation\, interpretation\, and promotion of American Indian history\, a
 rts\, customs\, and culture across North Carolina.\n\nLocation:\nN.C. Depa
