DESCRIPTION:The self-guided tour gives you the chance to see the interiors 
 of very special homes in the Downtown and DeGraffenried Historic Districts
  not normally open to the public. Homes range from glorious to tiny\, from
  18th century to restorations in progress. These are livable family homes 
 with rich stories and diverse architecture that illustrates New Bern's ama
 zing history. Add creative floral arrangements\, live music\, gardens in b
 loom\, artists\, and historical churches to the mix for an unforgettable t
 our! More details coming soon!
GEO:35.108209;-77.042284
LOCATION:New Bern Historical Society
SUMMARY:Heritage Homes Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/heritage-homes-tour
