DTSTART:20260502T130000Z
DTEND:20260502T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Since 1811 the Old Wilkesboro Presbyterian Church Cemetery\, lo
 cated at 299 E. South Street in Wilkesboro\, NC 28697\, has served as a fi
 nal resting place for loved ones. Join the Rendezvous Mountain Chapter of 
 the National Society Daughters of the American Revolution (RMC NSDAR)\, th
 e Town of Wilkesboro\, and your community as we serve together to honor ou
 r ancesters\, preserve history\, educate the next generation\, and show pa
 triotism as we celebrate the 250th birthday of America.\n\nWe invite you a
 nd your family members to team up with our knowledgeable preservationists 
 to unveil the historic headstones that algae\, lichen\, weather\, and eros
 ion have hidden.\n\nIf you would like more information about this event\, 
 please contact the Rendezvous Mountain Chapter\, NSDAR at: https:/www.ncda
 r.org/RendezvousMt
GEO:36.147808;-81.148893
LOCATION:Old Wilkesboro Presbyterian Church Cemetery
SUMMARY:Help Us Preserve the Old Wilkesboro Presbyterian Church Cemetery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/help-us-preserve-the-old-wil
 kesboro-presbyterian-church-cemetery
END:VEVENT
