 ing boat show in the southeast! Whether you’re a boating enthusiast or p
 refer to keep your feet on dry land\, the Annual Wooden Boat Show has acti
 vities for all ages.\n\nThis free event\, held each year on the first Satu
 rday in May\, celebrates the art of North Carolina’s traditional wooden 
 boatbuilding and the sport of sailboat racing.
