DTSTAMP:20260522T042637Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51974744842342
DTSTART:20260502T140000Z
DTEND:20260502T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:What better way to celebrate America’s 250th birthday than by
  visiting homes that witnessed that exciting time in our history.  The New
  Bern Historical Society’s Heritage Homes Tour invites you to tour homes
  from two historic neighborhoods.  Those in the Downtown Historic District
  date back to the revolutionary period and those in Riverside are inviting
  homes from one of New Bern’s first suburbs.  Join the crowds May 1-2\, 
 2026 from 10am to 4pm.  Soak up the history in 10 enchanting homes in 2 hi
 storic neighborhoods.\n\nEnjoy New Bern’s delightful springtime\, tour a
 mazing homes\, immerse yourself in history\, all while entertained by tale
 nted local musicians.\n\nTickets are available at www.NewBernHistorical.or
 g\, at 252-638-8558 or at the office at 511 Broad Street.  Outlets at Mitc
 hell hardware and both New Bern Harris Teeters will open on April 1. Ticke
 ts for members\, students and active duty military are $16\, for non-membe
 rs\, $19.  For group rates for 13 or more\, contact the office.
GEO:35.108209;-77.042284
LOCATION:Historic Downtown New Bern
SUMMARY:New Bern Heritage Homes Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/new-bern-heritage-homes-tour
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
END:VEVENT
