DESCRIPTION:POSTPONED UNTIL MAY -\n\nJoin us on Saturday May 2\, 2026\, fro
 m 7:00pm to 9:00pm at Morrow Mountain State Park for the Statewide Star Pa
 rty! We’ll have activities focusing on our theme\, “Mission to the Moo
 n\,” and stargazing. Representatives from the Charlotte Amateur Astronom
 ers Club\, as well as local astronomers\, will be standing by to answer qu
 estions and allow peeks through some high-powered telescopes! Meet in the 
 large parking lot adjacent to our swimming pool. Participants are encourag
 ed to bring telescopes and binoculars. Please try to limit light pollution
  once it gets dark. See you there! Rain date: Saturday May 2nd\, 2026. The
  NC Science Festival’s annual Statewide Star Party is made possible thro
 ugh the generous support of the NC Space Grant More information can be fou
 nd here: https://ncsciencefestival.org/events/statewide-star-party-morrow-
 mountain-state-park/
