DTSTART:20260503T200000Z
DTEND:20260503T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Storytellers is an intimate duo performance with Doni Zasloff a
 nd Eric Lindberg—a profound night of heartfelt music and mighty Jewish s
 pirit.\n\nAfter over a decade of making music together as founding members
  of progressive bluegrass band Nefesh Mountain\, Zasloff and Lindberg have
  created a new and transformative acoustic experience\, writing and gather
 ing songs and stories that have shaped their journey. This special perform
 ance explores a vast repertoire that spans seven albums of original bluegr
 ass\, folk\, Jewish\, country\, and Americana music.\n\nThe Storytellers e
 xperience also features a behind-the-scenes look at the stories and inspir
 ations from their songs\, as Zasloff and Lindberg interweave their own mus
 es\, tales from the road\, and personal experiences into the show.
GEO:35.807856;-78.703922
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Art
SUMMARY: NCMA Sacred Song Series: Nefesh Mountain’s Storytellers
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ncma-sacred-song-series-nefe
 sh-mountains-storytellers
