 appropriately for the weather\, wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSp
 aces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 2
 50-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in yo
 ur party and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is chang
