DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening with local author Marcia Phillips as she
  delves into the rich tapestry of North Carolina's history with her book\,
  "The Regulators in North Carolina: Prelude to the Revolution." This progr
 am will explore the tumultuous events of the late 1760s and early 1770s\, 
 shedding light on the courageous Regulators who stood up against colonial 
 corruption and laid the groundwork for the revolution.
