DESCRIPTION:Come meet Cornelius\, our ambassador corn snake! Cornelius will
  be available for an up close encounter at this program. Stop by to say he
 llo and learn about corn snake fun facts\, such as their diet and how they
  hunt\, how they navigate their environment\, the importance of snakes\, a
 nd more. All are welcome to attend this program at the Visitor Center\, 17
 90 Hanging Rock Park Road. For more information email hanging.rock@ncparks
 .gov
