  work on any other lap-friendly craft. Be sure to check out pieces of the 
 museum’s collection in the lobby and ask our security guards what really
  happens at night!\n\nDisclaimer: Attendees are encouraged to bring their 
 own materials for crafting. Lap-friendly crafts are art projects that can 
 be contained to a single theater seat and do not include the use of glue\,
  paint\, or glitter.
GEO:35.711793;-78.612032
LOCATION:Garner Performing Arts Center
