DESCRIPTION:America 250 Tea & Trivia: Founding Father Fun Facts & More!\nDa
 vidson County Historical Museum\nFree Admission\n\nJoin the Davidson Count
 y Historical Museum and our friends at Lexington Public Library for an eve
 ning of friendly competition as we celebrate America’s 250th anniversary
 . Test your knowledge of the Founding Fathers\, Revolutionary War history\
 , and the voices and documents that shaped the nation—while picking up s
 ome interesting facts along the way. Contestants will compete by answering
  questions on our big screen for a fun\, visual experience. Tea and tea sa
 ndwiches will be served\, including Conrad and Hinkles famous Pimento Chee
 se! Top Team wins gift cards to Lot 63 located in historic Old Salem in W-
 S\, N.C. Register your team (up to 6 players) to secure your goodie bags! 
