DESCRIPTION:06:00 PM - 06:55 PM\n\nVCAP\n\nThe Veteran Creative Arts Progra
 m will kick off the evening as the doors open at 6 p.m. 6-6:30 p.m. Line D
 ancing - join in the fun or observe and take in the music! 6:30-6:45 p.m. 
 VCAP Presentation - learn about VCAP and all they have to offer Veterans a
 nd First Responders. 6:45-6:55 VCAP - a short 10-minute presentation of VC
 AP art instructors.\n\n07:00 PM - 09:00 PM\n\nBrunswick Big Band\n\n7 - 9 
 p.m. - Join the Brunswick Big Band as they play selections from the Great 
 American Songbook. The Great American Songbook is a collection of the most
  influential American popular songs\, jazz standards\, and theater tunes f
 rom the early 20th century\, particularly the 1920s to 1950s.
