DESCRIPTION:A new guided tour centered on the horticultural practices of th
 e three groups of people once inhabiting this land: the Scots-Irish\, the 
 Catawba\, and enslaved Africans. Join us in learning about how these three
  groups used plants and herbs to sustain and heal their communities. The t
 our will run about 1 hour\, with a 30 minute hands-on demonstration/activi
 ty to follow.\n\nTour begins at 3pm\n\nMay 9th\, 16th\, 23rd and 30th\n\n$
 10 for adults and\n\n$8 for seniors (65+) and $5 for youth (3-17)\, and mi
 litary.
