DESCRIPTION:This year is America's 250th anniversary\, but how do you find 
 your Revolutionary ancestors? Could you be a Son of the American Revolutio
 n and not know it? Join us for a virtual presentation by Scott Norrick of 
 Ancestral Past\, where you will learn practical tips on finding potential 
 revolutionary ancestors. \n\nThis project was produced with assistance fro
 m the America 250 North Carolina initiative\, administered by the North Ca
 rolina Department of Natural and Cultural Resources. Any opinions\, findin
 gs\, and conclusions or recommendations expressed in this material are tho
 se of the author(s) and do not necessarily reflect the views of the State 
 of North Carolina.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:America at 250: Researching Revolutionary Ancestors
