 richment Center of Lee County\, NC will be offering a three-week video-bas
 ed course. Professors of history and politics will guide us on a journey t
 o the New World and discover the origins of the American spirit. This cour
 se consists of six documentary episodes (2 episodes per week). Complete th
 e episodes and the accompanying quizzes to receive the certificate of comp
 letion. \n\n\nWeek 2: Wednesday\, May 13\, 2026\, 2:00 - 4:00 p.m. - Natur
 e and Liberty & Frontier Wars\n\n\nThe Enrichment Center of Lee County hos
 ts activities and events for adults age 50+.
