DESCRIPTION:Come sweat with us! This full body workout mimicking animal mov
 ements can help reduce visceral fat. The first 5-10 minutes will focus on 
 stretching and warming up our muscle groups. This will be followed by 10 m
 inutes of body movement practice leading into a 20-minute circuit of those
  learned movements\, known as an AMRAP (as many rounds/reps as possible). 
 We’ll end with a 10-minute cool down. This will be physically challengin
 g\, but movements can be modified. Meet in the open lawn near the Visitor
 ’s Center. Program is weather dependent.
GEO:34.670531;-77.143056
