DESCRIPTION:Travel back to 1770s–1780s Cumberland County\, North Carolina
 \, when tensions are rising and the American colonies are on the brink of 
 revolution. In this immersive tabletop role-playing game\, you’ll step i
 nto the shoes of local citizens navigating loyalty\, rebellion and surviva
 l during a pivotal moment in history.\n\nExplore real historical events\, 
 regional battles and political intrigue as you make choices that shape you
 r story. Will you side with the Patriots\, remain loyal to the Crown or tr
 y to survive somewhere in between?\n\nNo prior role-playing experience is 
 necessary—just bring your imagination and your sense of adventure.\n\nRe
 gistration is required by calling 910-483-7727\, ext. 1365\, or registerin
 g online.
