DESCRIPTION:Gather up your Fellowship as the Museum becomes Middle Earth fo
 r a night. Lay siege to Gondor\, dance with dragons and show off your Tolk
 ien trivia at this adults 21+ event.\n\nEnjoy a unique opportunity to expe
 rience the Museum at night while exploring the uncensored side of science.
  The event features interactive science stations\, music\, games\, local e
 ntertainment and special activities. Beer\, wine\, themed cocktails and fo
 od will be available for purchase. Costumes encouraged (but not required).
 \n\nTickets: $25\; $15 Members. You must be 21 years or older to attend. A
  photo ID is required for entry.\n\nCOSTUME POLICY\n\nGuests wearing masks
  must remove them during check-in. They can then wear them during the even
 t.Footwear is required.Outfits should not contain elements that resemble o
 r could be mistaken for a real weapon.We reserve the right to refuse a gue
 st wearing a costume deemed offensive or unsafe.Any face or body paint mus
 t not obscure an attendee’s identity.
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
