DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, May 16th at the visitor center as we chec
 k out some of the birds that have arrived for the spring and summer!\n\nTh
 is birding program will be suitable for all ages and all levels of birding
  knowledge. We will meet in the visitor center at 8:00 for a brief introdc
 ution to birding and how to use the Merlin app\, which is a great resource
  for beginning birders. Afterwards we will go out and see what we can find
 . \n\nGuests are encouraged to bring their own binoculars. We have loaner 
 binoculars avaliable at the visitor center in limited supply. It is also a
 dvised to dress for the weather\, as part of this program will be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Birding with Merlin
