DESCRIPTION:Attention all cyclists!\n\nLet's bike and learn about the histo
 ry and nature around us. Join us for a scenic bike ride across the Little 
 Sugar Creek Greenway! Open to bikers of all skill levels\, ages 12+\n\nHel
 mets Required\n\nMay 16th\, 2026 | Ride starts at 9 am\n\nMeet at Polk Sta
 te Historic Site\n\nRoute: Little Sugar Creek Greenway North\n\nRegister b
 y May 14th\n\nSpace is limited
GEO:35.078;-80.882745
LOCATION:President James K. Polk Historic Site
