DESCRIPTION:Cultural Tasting: A Celebration of Food\, Culture & Community\n
 Saturday\, May 16\, 2026 | 1:00 p.m. – 5:00 p.m. Aycock Recreation Cente
 r | Henderson\, NC 27537\n\nCelebrate America's 250th anniversary by explo
 ring the diverse cultures that make up our community. Sample dishes from a
