DESCRIPTION:This presentation will shift the focus away from the Cumberland
  Association signers themselves to talk about the women in their lives. We
  will discuss the women's experiences during the Revolutionary War\, from 
 enemy threats to cunning rescues\, and even their experiences after the wa
 r.\n\nThis project was produced with assistance from the America 250 North
  Carolina initiative\, administered by the North Carolina Department of Na
 tural and Cultural Resources. Any opinions\, findings and conclusions or r
 ecommendations expressed in this material are those of the author(s) and d
 o not necessarily reflect the views of the State of North Carolina.
