DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and celebrate America’s 250th with the Hist
 orical Society on this immersive\, one-day journey to Charlotte! We’ll b
 egin at Historic Rosedale\, Charlotte’s second-oldest home\, and its pic
 turesque gardens. Then\, travel to the Charlotte Museum of History\, where
  you can dive into the past with the American Revolution Immersive Experie
 nce. Tickets will be $81\, lunch is not provided. Contact the Museum to RS
