UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51878259902761
DTSTART:20260522T140000Z
DTEND:20260522T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:KMHM is excited to present Women at the Edge of War: Carolina P
 iedmont's Heroines of the American Revolution. This exhibit highlights the
  daily courage and civic work of women in the Carolinas\, whose efforts we
 re essential to Revolutionary resistance and survival on the southern fron
 tier.\n\nThe exhibit will run from Feb. 17\, 2026 to May 30\, 2026. The mu
 seum is open Tues-Sat\, 10-4. Admission is free. Check out kingsmountainmu
 seum.org or call 704-739-1019 for more information.
GEO:35.239004;-81.342181
LOCATION:Kings Mountain Historical Museum
SUMMARY:Women at the Edge of War: Carolina Piedmont's Heroines of the Ameri
 can Revolution
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/women-at-the-edge-of-war-car
 olina-piedmonts-heroines-of-the-american-revolution
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Exhibitions
END:VEVENT
