DESCRIPTION:Help us kick off our Plott Hound Book Club with a metal stampin
 g bookmark-making workshop and book swap! Grab your previously read books 
 and head to Adventures in Bloom in downtown Apex for a one-of-a-kind exper
 ience. Your ticket grants you access to both the bookmark workshop and the
  book swap. After crafting your own metal-stamped bookmark\, hang out with
  other PHLC readers and pick up any of the books that catch your eye in th
 e swap! Not a PHLC book club member? That’s OK—join us anyway! Beverag
 es and snacks are BYOB. \n\nPlease note: Due to space restrictions\, visit
 ors in groups should buy multiple tickets simultaneously to guarantee seat
 s together.\n\nFree parking is available behind the building next to the t
 rain tracks on a first-come\, first-served basis. To learn more about Adve
 ntures in Bloom\, visit their website.
GEO:35.731159;-78.851153
LOCATION:Adventures in Bloom
SUMMARY:Metal Stamping Bookmark Workshop and Book Swap
