DESCRIPTION:Join staff from the Library of North Carolina’s Government an
 d Heritage Library and the NC Museum of Natural Sciences for a Native Plan
 t Walk focusing on gardening with native plants to attract and support bir
 ds.\n\nThis plant walk will explore native plantings in the NC Department 
 of Natural and Cultural Resources’ Native Plant Meadow and the NC Museum
  of Natural Science’s Native Plant Garden. The event will take place pri
 marily outdoors\, with participants traveling approximately ½ mile round-
 trip via paved sidewalks.\n\nRegistration is requested at slnc.info/plantw
 alk526.\n\nThis event is hosted in connection with the GHL's Native Plant 
