DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week\, we will be looki
 ng at the amazing world of Dragonflies! While these ariel predators are kn
 own for their speed in the skies\, not many people know that their life be
 gins in the water. Come on out and join us as we learn more about what mak
 es these creatures so special. \n\nThis program will begin promptly at 10 
 AM at the visitor center. All ages are welcome. Guests are encouraged to d
 ress for the weather as we will be outside for part of this program.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Ranger Cody's Dashing Dragonflies
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-codys-dashing-dragonf
 lies
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Lectures & Talks
END:VEVENT
