DESCRIPTION:Did you know that the Headquarters Library is almost 40 years o
 ld? Come to the library on Monday\, June 1st to celebrate the library's 40
 th birthday! Look at the new mural on the side of the building to a celebr
 ation of the library and 80s history! Light refreshments will be provided.
  \n\nThis project was produced with assistance from the America 250 North 
 Carolina initiative\, administered by the North Carolina Department of Nat
 ural and Cultural Resources. Any opinions\, findings\, and conclusions or 
 recommendations expressed in this material are those of the author(s) and 
 do not necessarily reflect the views of the State of North Carolina
GEO:35.055443;-78.881263
LOCATION:Cumberland County Public Library\, Pate Room
SUMMARY:Library Mural Unveiling
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/library-mural-unveiling
