DESCRIPTION:Come to West Street Dog in downtown Raleigh for America 250 NC 
 trivia!\n\nMonday\, June 1\, 6:30p-8p. Three rounds\, a prize bag for the 
 winner of each round! \n\n21 and older.\n\nTrivia is free.\n\nFriendly\, s
 payed/neutered\, and vaccinated dogs welcomed. $5 per dog\, $8 for two dog
 s. Read more about bringing dogs: https://www.weststreetdog.com/\n\n \n\n-
 --------------------------\n\nCalling all NC nerds\, history buffs\, and t
 rivia lovers!\n\nOn Monday\, June 1st\, we’ll be hosting a special trivi
 a night with our friends from America 250 NC\, an organization dedicated t
 o preserving and sharing NC history and stories.\n\nExpect:\n\nSwag‑pack
 ed prizes (magnets\, koozies\, bracelets\, mini flags)\n\nA quick intro fr
 om the awesome team\n\nCommemorative coasters with QR codes to mini histor
 y videos\n\nDrinks\, dogs\, and bragging rights\n\nThree rounds\, ten ques
 tions each\, with an overall America 250 NC theme\n\nDon’t forget - triv
 ia is free to play! Bring your crew and your NC pride!
GEO:35.784977;-78.645227
LOCATION:West Street Dog
SUMMARY:America 250 NC Trivia at West Street Dog
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/america-250-nc-trivia-at-wes
 t-street-dog
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
END:VEVENT
