DESCRIPTION:Join Mayo River State Park for our annual FAMILY FISHING DAY! A
  fun-filled day with lots of activities for the whole family.\n\nOn-site R
 EGISTRATION begins at 9:00am at MAYO MOUNTAIN ACCESS\, 500 Old Mayo Park R
 oad\, Mayodan\, NC 27027. FISHING DERBY with prizes in age-appropriate cat
 egories for participants 16 years and younger. All children must be ACCOMP
 ANIED BY AN ADULT who will be in the park and supervising them at all time
 s. PRIZES awarded around 2:00pm. The day is also a LICENSE-EXEMPT fishing 
 day for adults.\n\nBRING YOUR OWN bait/tackle\, extra drinking water/snack
 s\, sunscreen and bug repellent. FREE hot dogs\, chips and drinks while th
 ey last. DIY WORKSHOP for kids.\n\nJoin us for a NATURALLY WONDERFUL day i
 n the park! For more information call the park office at 336-427-2530.
GEO:36.439192;-79.948638
LOCATION:Mayo River State Park\, Mayo Mountain Access
SUMMARY:Family Fishing Day
