 50 theme that will include an encampment of Revolutionary War soldiers\, p
 eriod music\, a range of special programs including medical treatment duri
 ng the war\, an inspiring children’s play\, and historic and entertainin
 g presentations among the 40 planned activities and other surprises.  The 
 day will end with a special concert on the waterfront by a band called "Th
 e Patriots\," followed by a spectacular "Salute to America" fireworks disp
 lay bursting from 6 fireworks barges stationed on the Roanoke River.
