 lonial craft demonstrations that bring the 18th century to life.\n\nExperi
 ence life on the frontier with:\n\nGuided tours of the museum’s six hist
 oric cabinsTraditional skills like blacksmithing\, hearth cooking\, and wo
 ol spinningTomahawk throwing - test your frontier skills!Perfect for histo
 ry lovers of all ages\, Dan’l Boone Day offers a unique opportunity to l
