DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 4th Annual African American Art Exhibit hosted 
 by the African American Heritage and Culture Center! Celebrating African A
 merican artists\, African American Music Month\, and Juneteenth!\n\nSaturd
 ay\, June 6\, 2026\, | 12:00 PM –3:00 PM  St. Cyprian's Episcopal Church
 \, 604 Johnson St.\, New Bern\, NC FREE & open to all ages!\n\nBrowse orig
 inal paintings\, photography\, crochet\, and pottery by local African Amer
 ican artists all displayed beneath the church's beautiful stained-glass wi
 ndows. Meet the artists\, enjoy live music\, and try our Paint & Sip downs
 tairs with an America250 theme! Kids and adults are welcome to join a grou
 p coloring activity too.\n\nCome support our community! No ticket needed. 
 Donations gratefully accepted. \n\n All ages welcome See you there! \n\nFo
 r info: thecenterofnewbern@gmail.com | (252) 688-0087
GEO:35.111209;-77.042609
