DESCRIPTION:Watch Sinners With Us | Saturday\, June 6th\, 2pm at Main Libra
 ry in Hillsborough | As part of BLAC Fest\, Orange County Public Library's
  Black Literature Arts & Culture Festival leading up to Juneteenth\, we ar
 e holding a screening of Sinners\, the award winning Ryan Coogler film sta
 rring Michael B. Jordan. Free popcorn and drinks will be included during t
 he event. Because the film is rated R\, this event is for visitors 18+ onl
 y.  Click here for additional BLAC Fest event information.
