DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week we will look into 
 some of the skills that got humanity to where we are now\; Navigation. We 
 will cover ways of using navigation tools like maps and a compass\, as wel
 l as why they are important skills to have before going out to put our ski
 lls to the test. \n\nThis program will start promptly at 10 AM at the visi
 tor center. Guests are encouraged to dress for the weather as part of this
  program will be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Ranger Katie's Cool Compass Course
