DTSTART:20260608T203000Z
DTEND:20260608T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:The 250th Anniversary of our great nation is upon us\, and ther
 e are many aspects of our history that we may not know.   For example\, ou
 r American flag has evolved and changed many times over the years.  Have y
 ou ever wondered what our very first flag looked like\, and how and why it
  changed during the time of our American Revolution?  Members of the New B
 ern Chapter of the Sons of the American Revolution will display and share 
 some of the exciting history behind our flag\, as well as other interestin
 g information\, during their presentation on June 8\, 2026\, at 4:30 pm.  
 For more information\, please contact us at 252-566-3772 or at lagrange@ne
 uselibrary.org.
GEO:35.305107;-77.787537
LOCATION:La Grange Public Library
SUMMARY:Flags of the American Revolution
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/flags-of-the-american-revolu
 tion
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Lectures & Talks
END:VEVENT
