 .\n\n \n\nGather your crew\, grab some popcorn and relive the magic of One
 -Eyed Willy’s hidden gold on the big screen. Before the movie\, explore 
 the Museum’s own "hidden treasures" with themed activities that bring th
 e movie’s mysteries to life.\n\n \n\nEvent Highlights:\n\n• Feature Fi
 lm: The Goonies (Rated PG)\n\n• Themed Fun: Hands-on science led by Muse
 um experts.\n\n• Snacks: Grab your favorite movie treats.\n\n• Movie T
 rivia: Prove you’re a real Goonie and test your knowledge.\n\n \n\nGet Y
 our Tickets: https://ncmns.net/GooniesMovie\n\n \n\nDon't let the Fratelli
 s beat you to it — mark your calendars and get ready for an adventure!
