  NC where Dr. Tony Zeiss will tell the story of young people during the re
 volutionary war at 2:00 with refreshments to follow.  Tours of the cemetar
 y\, where many Revolutionary war patriots are buried will be at 1:00 and 4
 :00. Presented by the Mary Slocumb Chapter DAR and the Mooresville Museum.
