  Public Library\, Camden County Tourism Development Authority\, and our va
 lued community partners are excited to host our 4th Annual Juneteenth: Cel
 ebration of Freedom on Saturday\, June 13\, 2026\, from 10:00AM - 2:00PM a
 t the Camden County Public Library and Community Room.\n\nThis year's cele
 bration will kick off with a special program and performances by the Camde
 n Community Choir and CC Ryder Band\, made possible through support from t
 he North Carolina Arts Coincil Grassroots Funds. Throughout the day\, gues
 ts will enjoy a variety of family friendly activities\, including face pai
 nting\, educational exhibits\, games\, crafts\, a bounce house\, FREE Broo
 kie B's Lemonade\, FREE hot dogs and chips\, and much more.\n\nIf you are 
 interested in participating with a booth or display-please contact Alfreda
  Gordon at agordon@camdencountync.gov or 252-331-2543.\n\nWe hope you will
