DESCRIPTION:Join The Town of Seven Devils and a Park Ranger for this Great 
 Campout- Overnight Adventure. Learn how to pitch a tent\, build a campfire
 \, cook over a campfire\, and use Leave No Trace Principles all while enjo
 ying games and storytelling.\n\nDon't have any camping gear\, no problem! 
 Tents\, sleeping bags\, and sleeping pads will be provided to use so any a
 nd all camping experiences are welcome! \n\n10 spots are available\, a cha
 perone 18 years or older MUST accompany and camp overnight with the camper
 . Please email parksandrec@sevendevilsnc.gov to register. Please list any 
 allergies in your registration email as food and snacks will be provided. 
 Must register by June 5th.
