DTSTAMP:20260522T042640Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52559600487833
DTSTART:20260614T200000Z
DTEND:20260615T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the spirit of a nation at Stars\, Stripes\, and Sound
 s on June 14th from 4:00 PM to 8:00 PM at Jacksonville Commons—an unforg
 ettable evening of music\, patriotism\, and community in honor of America
 ’s 250th.\n\nThis prestigious concert will feature a powerful collaborat
 ion between the renowned 2nd Marine Division Band and the distinguished Ba
 nd of America’s Few. Together\, they will deliver a stirring performance
  filled with patriotic favorites\, timeless classics\, and inspiring music
 al tributes that honor the legacy and future of our nation.\n\nGuests can 
 enjoy a festive atmosphere with a variety of food trucks\, America 250th-t
 hemed vendors\, and a beer garden offering refreshing beverages for purcha
 se. Whether you're coming for the music\, the celebration\, or the communi
 ty spirit\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy.\n\nBe sure to bring
  a lawn chair or blanket to relax and comfortably take in this special eve
 ning under the open sky.\n\nJoin us as we celebrate 250 years of America w
 ith music\, pride\, and unforgettable moments at Stars\, Stripes\, and Sou
 nds.
LOCATION:Jacksonville Commons Festival Grounds
SUMMARY:Stars\, Stripes\, and Sounds: Celebrating 250 Years of America
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/stars-stripes-and-sounds-cel
 ebrating-250-years-of-america
END:VEVENT
