X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260522T042640Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52948207210478
DTSTART:20260614T210000Z
DTEND:20260615T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Participating teachers will explore 250-year-old primary source
 s relating to their county or region in the Archives’ Search Room to bui
 ld DocsBoxes for their classrooms. Archives staff will help locate and int
 erpret materials to connect specific records to larger stories. With Carol
 ina K-12's guidance\, the group will devise classroom engagement strategie
 s for the materials they discover.
GEO:35.78292;-78.637155
LOCATION:State Archives\, 109 E Jones St. Raleigh NC.
SUMMARY:Archives Teacher Institute 250
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/archives-teacher-institute-2
 50
