DESCRIPTION:Hear ye! Hear ye! Step into our new interactive family exhibit 
 to explore life in northeastern North Carolina during the American Revolut
 ion. Experience living history demonstrations\, interact with colonial his
 torians\, and engage in hands-on activities as we celebrate the exhibit op
 ening and commemorate America 250 North Carolina. Visit a petting zoo from
  10:30 a.m. to 1:30 p.m. and enjoy a special musical performance by the Fi
 fes and Drums of York Town at noon.\n\nPreregistration required for groups
  of 10 or more.
GEO:36.296532;-76.219757
LOCATION:Museum of the Albemarle
SUMMARY:Exhibit Opening: Discover Colonial Life
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/exhibit-opening-discover-col
 onial-life
