 in a town that relies on a tobacco economy. \n\nPlease read the book prior
  to the discussion. We recommend borrowing from your local library. \n\nFr
 ee and open to the public. No membership required. Come to whichever book 
 talks spark your interest. \n\nMeeting Link\n\nMore Information\n\nSign up
  for an Email Reminder
