DESCRIPTION:At the Southwest Brunswick Branch Library Center Pit\n\nThomas 
 Jefferson was the principal author of the Declaration of Independence\, wh
 ich created the United States.  To celebrate the Declaration's upcoming 25
 0th birthday on July 4\, 2026\, Monticello\, the Jefferson house\,  is lau
 nching Declaration Book Club\, featuring short readings\, lively videos\, 
 and probing questions to spark discussion of our past\, present\, and futu
 re as one people\, created equal. What did Jefferson and his cosigners dec
 lare in 1776--and how do you pursue life\, liberty\, and happiness today? 
 \n\nBook club readings can be found here: https://www.monticello.org/bookc
 lub/\n\nJoin the discussion afterwards with our community members.
GEO:33.922523;-78.578901
LOCATION:Southwest Brunswick Branch Library\, Center Pit
