DESCRIPTION:On June 19th\, 2026 at 10:00 AM\, Dr. Latif Tarik\, an Associat
 e Professor of History at Elizabeth City State University\, will speak abo
 ut marronage and the use of the Dismal Swamp as a refuge for freedom seeke
 rs. Following the presentation\, guests are encouraged to reflect on what 
 they learned while strolling along the park’s boardwalk. A park staff me
 mber will lead a walk at 11:00 AM and 11:45 AM while sharing about the par
 k’s unique natural environment.
GEO:36.441375;-76.338801
