UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52888311188032
DTSTART:20260620T130000Z
DTEND:20260620T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a morning of movement\, mindfulness\, and meaning a
 s we honor Juneteenth with grace\, gratitude\, and community.\n\nIn Celera
 tion of our 100 Anniversary: A Century of Community\, Legacy\, and Love - 
 Ubuntu and Tzedakah\n\n \n\nA peaceful celebration of freedom\, community\
 , and renewal\n\nStep onto the sun‑kissed lawn of the Historic Russell S
 chool and join us for a gentle\, soul‑centering Outdoor Pilates on the L
 awn experience in honor of Juneteenth. Surrounded by the quiet beauty of t
 his sacred historic space\, we’ll move\, breathe\, and reconnect with th
 e joy of freedom — in our bodies\, our spirits\, and our community.\n\nT
 his uplifting session blends mindful movement with the serenity of nature\
 , creating a space where wellness meets heritage. Whether you’re a seaso
 ned Pilates lover or brand‑new to the practice\, this class invites you 
 to slow down\, stretch deeply\, and celebrate the resilience and brillianc
 e of our shared story.\n\nLet the breeze guide your breath. Let the earth 
 support your grounding. Let this moment be a peaceful offering to yourself
  and a tribute to the generations who paved the way.\n\nPlease bring your 
 own mat\; a small number will be provided for those who need one. The sess
 ion will open with an affirmation to center our energy and intention.\n\nP
 lease park in the church parking for a short walk to the school lawn.\n\nR
 ain Date: June 27\, 2026\n\nAbout the Instructor: Erinn\, owner of Sanado\
 , offers her passion and expertise to create a grounding\, uplifting exper
 ience.\n\nConnect with her: Instagram: @Sanado * hello@sanadowellness.com 
 * 314-599-7602
GEO:36.123715;-78.944532
LOCATION:Historic Russell School
SUMMARY:Outdoor Pilates on the "Lawn" — A Juneteenth Wellness Experience
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/outdoor-pilates-on-the-lawn-
 a-juneteenth-wellness-experience
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Workshops & Trainings
END:VEVENT
