 s with young children can enjoy stories themed around Juneteenth and the F
 ourth of July in the Vance house at 9:30am\, 10:30am\, and 11:30am. There 
 will be free face-painting\, popsicles\, and fun crafts in the visitor cen
 ter as well!\n\nThis event is free and does not require registering in adv
 ance\, but donations are encouraged. Our storytimes are held seasonally/qu
 arterly. If you have any questions\, feel free to reach out to us at vance
