 e 18-20\, 2026\; Elizabethtown\, NC. The theme for 2026 is "Freedom: Yeste
 rday's Legacy\, Today's Promise\, Tomorrow's Hope".\n\nOn Saturday\, June 
 20th\, we will kick off with a We encourage participation from queens\, ki
 ngs\, schools\, colleges\, community members\, politicians\, businesses\, 
 organizations\, Masonic Brothers\, Eastern Stars\, Divine-9\, county and h
 ospital departments/employees and other groups to make this celebration ev
 en more vibrant and memorable. If you or your organization desires to part
 icipate email\, abullock1951@gmail.com for more information
