DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger at Lake Norman State Park for some family fishing
  fun! We will be learning about the different types of fish found in Lake 
 Norman and the different fishing methods and gear you'll need to catch the
 m.\n\n \n\nPlease dress accordingly for the weather and be sure to bring s
 ome water\, sunscreen\, and bug spray.\n\n \n\n*NC fishing licenses are re
