DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Second Annual Memorial Pop Top Checkers Tournament\, t
 o be held June 25-27\, 2026 will attract players from all over the region.
   Held in the charming town of Waxhaw. NC\, the tournament offers not only
  a change to compete but also an opportunity to explore the rich history o
 f this historical location.  \n\nParticipants and spectators alike can enj
 oy a weedend filled with checkers while experiencing the culture\, history
  and charm that is historic Waxhaw\, North Carolina.  Whether you're a sea
 soned player or a curios newcomer\, the tournament promises an unforgettab
 le experience for everyone.\n\nFor more information visit www.poptopchecke
 rs.com
GEO:34.924604;-80.742522
LOCATION:Waxhaw Woman's Club
SUMMARY:W.H. Collins/Maxwell McCain 2nd Annual Memorial "Pop Top" Checkers 
