DESCRIPTION:Join a Park Ranger and discover the world of the pollinators. W
 ho are they? How do they live? Why are they so important to the natural wo
 rld? We'll take a hike around our field ecosystem to see them in action. H
 appy National Pollinator Week!\n\nAll children must be accompanied by an a
 dult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\, wear hiking 
 shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSpaces are limited\, and registration is requi
