 ina's role in the American Revolution will be on display in the Shelton Ho
 use barn.  Members of SAR and DAR will be onsite to help visitors learn ho
 w to identify ancestors who fought in the American Revolution.  The Festiv
 al is free and includes food trucks\, live music\, activities for kids\, a
