 th a free\, family-friendly day of artmaking\, performances\, and communit
 y connection at the North Carolina Museum of Art. Enjoy hands-on art activ
 ities inspired by Western North Carolina craft traditions\, live music\, a
 nd creative demonstrations from regional artists. Explore the exhibition K
