DESCRIPTION:It's America's 250th birthday - celebrate with America250 trivi
 a!\n\nQuestions will be drawn from the US Citizenship test\, as well as hi
 story\, geography\, and pop culture. \n\nFamily Trivia is an all ages even
 t\, but these questions will be most appropriate for rising 4th graders an
 d up. Teams of up to five are encouraged (and it's a good idea to have a m
 ultiple generations on your team). No team no problem you can form one at 
 the library or go solo!\n\nWinners will get bragging rights (and a prize).
  \n\nRegistration is required. A minimum of five players are needed. The e
