 ute to the iconic songs of Billy Joel. Fans will experience full symphonic
  orchestrations on some of his most beloved hits including “Only the Goo
 d Die Young\,” “Piano Man\,” “New York State of Mind\,” “You M
 ay Be Right\,” “Movin’ Out\,” “My Life\,” and many more. \n\nP
 ack your picnic! Summerfest offers great music under the stars at Koka Boo
 th Amphitheatre in Cary—and remember\, kids 12 & under are always admitt
 ed free on the lawn!\n\nNorth Carolina SymphonySophie Mok\, conductor Tony
  DeSare\, vocalist\, piano
