DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week we will go back in
  time to see some of the games that were played back in the era revolution
 ary war in the U.S. with special guest star\, Amanda\, from Historic Edent
 on! Amanda will take us through several fun games that kids played during 
 the time. Come on out and experience a little bit of history as part of ou
 r A250 Celebration. \n\nThis program will start promptly at 10 AM at the v
 isitor center. Guests are encouraged to dress for the weather as part of t
 his program will be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Historic Edenton - Colonial Games
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/historic-edenton-colonial-ga
 mes
