DESCRIPTION:Guided tours of Fort Macon are available daily at 11:00 a.m.\, 
 1:00 p.m.\, and 3:00 p.m. during the summer season from mid April to mid O
 ct.\n\nOn Cannon days there will only be one Fort Tour scheduled at 12:00 
 noon. \n\nTours last about 45 minutes.\n\nMeet at the fort entrance. Pets 
 are not allowed inside the fort.\n\n \n\nPhoto by C. Peek: The fort at For
 t Macon State Park
