DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and celebrate America 250 with a charming col
 onial-style tea. Enjoy light refreshments\, sweet treats\, and simple plea
 sures inspired by the past while learning about colonial traditions. Parti
 cipants will create their own posy\, a small hand-held bouquet popular in 
 colonial times\, to take home. Guests are encouraged to dress in colonial-
 inspired attire if they wish for an extra touch of fun. Registration Requi
 red.
GEO:35.685925;-81.366562
LOCATION:Southwest Branch Library of Catawba County Public Library
SUMMARY:Colonial Tea and Posy Party
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/colonial-tea-and-posy-party
END:VEVENT
