DESCRIPTION:Liberty on Main is the City of Roanoke Rapids’ Independence D
 ay celebration\, bringing together the community for a patriotic parade an
 d downtown festival on July 4\, 2026.\n\nThe day begins with a community p
 arade featuring local organizations\, businesses\, bands\, and first respo
 nders\, followed by a family-friendly festival with vendors\, activities\,
  and entertainment in the Main Street district.\n\nDesigned to create a we
 lcoming and engaging experience for all ages\, Liberty on Main highlights 
 community pride\, local participation\, and the shared traditions that bri
 ng people together.\n\nThis event brought to you by the City of Roanoke Ra
 pids Main Street Program and Advisory Committee.\n\nVendors and parade par
 ticipants must register at MainStreetRoanokeRapids.com/250 by June 15\, 20
 26.
