DESCRIPTION:On July 4\, at 10 am\, the town of Mocksville will host a cerem
 ony to open the Mocksville Bicentennial Time Capsule. This capsule was ded
 icated on December 12\, 1976\, which marked the end of the Bicentennial ce
 lebration. Attendees will be allowed to witness the capsule's opening and 
 to see firsthand the items that have been buried within for the last forty
 -nine and a half years. \n\nThe link to the event is listed below. Scroll 
 down until the subheading titled "Opening the Past: Mocksville’s Bicente
 nnial Time Capsule" appears.
