DESCRIPTION:CELEBRATING MUSIC THROUGH 250 YEARS AND BEYOND!\n\nCelebrate th
 e Fourth of July with a spectacular family-friendly concert at the Live Oa
 k Bank Pavilion\, featuring the Wilmington Symphony Orchestra (WSO) and sp
 ecial guests.\n\nHighlights of the evening include guest appearances\, pat
 riotic favorites\, pops\, classics\, and spectacular fireworks display.\n\
 nFireworks will start at 9:00 p.m.\, launched from a barge at the converge
 nce of the Cape Fear and Northeast Cape Fear Rivers\, just north of the pa
 rk. This concert is FREE to attend!
GEO:34.248663;-77.950746
