DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Sanford for a fun-filled evening at Red\, Whit
 e\, and Blue Bash as we celebrate Independence Day in style! Enjoy live pe
 rformances from incredible bands\, indulge in a variety of tasty treats fr
 om local food trucks\, and wrap up the night with a breathtaking fireworks
  show. It's an event for all ages\, perfect for making memories with famil
 y and friends as we come together to honor freedom and enjoy the summer ni
 ght!
GEO:35.473378;-79.195411
