DESCRIPTION:This July 4th marks the nation’s 250th anniversary! Chapel Hi
 ll is celebrating with a new type of show that reimagines their long-stand
 ing community gathering.\n\nTechnology meets creativity in this year’s d
 rone show at Chapel Hill High School\, presented by Skyworx. A collection 
 of 300 synchronized drones will lift off and arrange themselves into shape
 s and images\, using light and color to paint designs across the Chapel Hi
 ll sky.\n\nLearn more: https://www.chapelhillarts.org/calendar/july-4th/
GEO:35.945848;-79.079952
LOCATION:Chapel Hill High School
SUMMARY:Chapel Hill July 4th Drone Show
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/chapel-hill-july-4th-drone-s
 how
