DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour of Revolutionary War sites around Cumberland
  County. From Cross Creek Cemetery #1 to Old Bluff Cemetery\, experience t
 he local sites and stories of the American Revolution. The tour will last 
 around 2 hours.\n\nRegistration is required by calling or emailing the Loc
 al & State History Department.
GEO:35.055443;-78.881263
LOCATION:Cumberland County Public Library 
SUMMARY:Cumberland County Revolutionary Bus Tour
