UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52859277896457
DTSTART:20260706T140000Z
DTEND:20260706T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nThis week we will cover anim
 al tracks! Everthing that moves leaves a track\, and there is often a lot 
 you can learn from them. From coyotes to beaver to birds\, we will go over
  a few of the distict tracks we find here at the Millpond\, so come on out
  and join us as we learn about these amazing animal tracks!\n\nThis progra
 m will start promptly at 10 AM at the visitor center. Guests are encourage
 d to dress for the weather as part of this program will be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Ranger Alan's Amazing Animal Tracks
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-alans-amazing-animal-
 tracks
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
