BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260522T042642Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52860868354551
DTSTART:20260720T140000Z
DTEND:20260720T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Its that time of year again! Come celebrate the summer at Merch
 ants Millpond State Park with our 4th year of the Summer Junior Adventure 
 Series! In this series\, we have a different topic that we teach about eve
 ry Monday at 10 AM throughout the summer. \n\nCome soak up the summer sun 
 with this week's theme\; reptiles! Ranger Joe will be coming down to tell 
 us abou all the things that make reptiles unique and special. From tiny tu
 rtles to large alligators\, reptiles come in all shapes and size\, which i
 s one of the reasons we're glad to have them around the Millpond. Come lea
 rn about some our favorites!\n\nThis program will start promptly at 10 AM 
 at the visitor center. Guests are encouraged to dress for the weather as p
 art of this program may be outside.
GEO:36.437278;-76.701271
LOCATION:Merchants Millpond State Park\, Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Ranger Joe's Radical Reptiles
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-joes-radical-reptiles
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260522T042642Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52903770406486
DTSTART:20260720T150000Z
DTEND:20260720T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Guided tours of Fort Macon are available daily at 11:00 a.m.\, 
 1:00 p.m.\, and 3:00 p.m. during the summer season from mid April to mid O
 ct.\n\nOn Cannon days there will only be one Fort Tour scheduled at 12:00 
 noon. \n\nTours last about 45 minutes.\n\nMeet at the fort entrance. Pets 
 are not allowed inside the fort.\n\n \n\nPhoto by C. Peek: The fort at For
 t Macon State Park
GEO:34.696366;-76.684506
LOCATION:Fort Macon State Park\, Ft. Macon
SUMMARY:Fort Macon Daily Tours - 11 am\, 1 pm\, & 3 pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/fort-macon-daily-tours-11-am
 -1-pm-3-pm
