DTSTART:20260724T140000Z
DTEND:20260724T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour of Revolutionary War sites around downtown F
 ayetteville! From Liberty Point to Greene Street\, you will experience the
  local stories of the American Revolution! \n\nRegistration is required. C
 all 910-483-7727 ext. 1365 or email lsh@cumberlandcountync.gov to register
 . The tour will last around 2 hours. Moderate walking is required.
