DESCRIPTION:How did colonists prepare their households for the seasons? Wha
 t was bathing and hygiene like? How did soldiers clean their wool uniforms
 ? How were plants and herbs used to freshen things up? Join our costumed i
 nterpreters as they demonstrate practices of cleanliness in the 18th and 1
 9th centuries. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
GEO:35.979741;-79.992174
LOCATION:High Point Museum
SUMMARY:Getting Colonial Clean in the Historical Park
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/getting-clean-in-the-park-in
