DTSTART:20260725T150000Z
DTEND:20260725T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we delve into the enlightenment age of dentistry!\n\
 nWithout its 18th century foundations\, dental chairs\, porcelain teeth\, 
 modern dentures\, and specific tools for dentists\, oral care would be muc
 h worse! After this presentation\, you’ll want to give your dentist and 
 dental assistants a “plaque.”\n\nFind out the Tooth\, the Whole Tooth\
 , and nothing by the Tooth on how our founding fathers took care of their 
 oral hygiene and why we should be happy to have the dentists of today.\n\n
 This event is part of the museum’s Deep Dive Into History series\, progr
 ams designed to give visitors a deeper understanding of our shared past th
 rough costumed interpretation and hands-on learning. Each Deep Dive delves
  into a specific theme in Lower Cape Fear history. This event is FREE\, bu
 t donations are always appreciated.
GEO:33.918176;-78.0178
LOCATION:North Carolina Maritime Museum at Southport
SUMMARY:DEEP DIVE INTO HISTORY The Root of the Problem: 18th Century Dentis
 try
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/deep-dive-into-history-the-r
 oot-of-the-problem-18th-century-dentistry
