DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the establishment of the Colonial Navy by the Contine
 ntal Congress on September 13\, 1775\, with demonstrations of all things n
 aval: ropemaking\, signal flags\, maps\, naval stores\, spinning and weavi
 ng\, blacksmithing. Learn about Bath and its role in the naval life of the
  colony. Munitions demonstrations scheduled throughout the day.
