BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260522T042643Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52543913626450
DTSTART:20260919T150000Z
DTEND:20260919T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience life in the Southern Appalachian backcountry during 
 the American Revolution at our Militia Muster! Guests of all ages are invi
 ted to step into the world of 18th-century militia life through interactiv
 e demonstrations\, reenactments\, and hands-on activities.\n\nWatch as 18t
 h Century Militia reenactors bring history to life through drills\, camp l
 ife\, and mock recruitment scenes. Explore the daily challenges faced by s
 ettlers and soldiers\, and learn more about what it took to fight for inde
 pendence in the mountains of North Carolina.\n\nThis is a family-friendly\
 , immersive educational event perfect for history lovers\, homeschool fami
 lies\, and curious visitors of all ages.\n\nPlease call 828-264-2120 for t
 icketing information.
GEO:36.208683;-81.669982
LOCATION:Hickory Ridge History Museum
SUMMARY:Militia Muster Event - Experience 18th Century
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/militia-muster-event-experie
 nce-18th-century
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
CATEGORIES:Reenactments & Living History
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Special Site Programs
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Youth & Family Activities
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260522T042643Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51931164602126
DTSTART:20260919T194500Z
DTEND:20260919T204500Z
DESCRIPTION:Step into Tryon Palace and explore Diana Gabaldon’s award-win
 ning Outlander series. Learn about the lives of the fictional Jamie and Cl
 aire Fraser\, their family and friends\, and interactions with historical 
 figures and events in the tumultuous period of the American Revolution.\n\
 nTour covers storylines from Outlander books 4 – 8 and the Starz Outland
 er seasons 4 – 8. (For those not current on the books or show\, there wi
 ll be spoilers for these books and seasons.)\n\nTour begins at 301 George 
 Street\, across from the Tryon Palace Main Gates. Ticket holders should ch
 eck in at the Waystation ticketing desk no later than 3:30 p.m.
GEO:35.104831;-77.043044
LOCATION:Tryon Palace Historic Sites and Gardens
SUMMARY:Discover Tryon Palace: Outlander
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/discover-tryon-palace-outlan
 der
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Guided Tours
END:VEVENT
