DESCRIPTION:Experience the magic of MumFest\, a delightful fall festival in
  historic downtown New Bern! Enjoy live music\, thrilling amusements\, del
 icious food\, unique local artists and vendors\, and a fantastic beer gard
 en - all set against a stunning waterfront background. With over 75\,000 a
 ttendees last year\, this unforgettable weekend is the perfect way to cele
 brate the season with family and friends. Mark your calendars now - come j
 oin the fun!
LOCATION:New Bern
SUMMARY:MumFest
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/mumfest
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Fairs
