DESCRIPTION:The American Revolution certainly changed the way people mourne
 d and coped with death. Come learn about the change in mourning practices 
 and traditions of the country from Colony to Early American Republic. of m
 ourning during and after the war. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
GEO:35.979741;-79.992174
LOCATION:High Point Museum
SUMMARY:Revolutionary Mourning in the Historical Park
