DESCRIPTION:Join us at Brunswick Town/Fort Anderson State Historic Site for
  the return of Port Brunswick Day! Living historians will be interpreting 
 various colonial trades and aspects of colonial life\, including candle ma
 king\, blacksmithing\, woodworking\, and more. Kids will have an opportuni
 ty to experience colonial toys and games. This event is free. All ages are
  welcome.
GEO:34.040206;-77.946023
