DESCRIPTION:Experience an authentic Christmas of long ago in the warm glow 
 of lantern light.  Enjoy homes\, public buildings\, and taverns decorated 
 for the season with festive\, all-natural décor.  Interactive historical 
 vignettes will bring each building to life.  Enjoy a warm fire in the Tap 
 Room tavern\, just as guests did two hundred years ago! Tickets go on sale
  Nov. 1st.  \n\n \n\nFee\, ticket required.
GEO:36.33002;-77.58941
LOCATION:Historic Halifax
SUMMARY:Yuletide by Lanternlight
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/yuletide-by-lanternlight
