DESCRIPTION:Experience the evolution of Moravian Christmas traditions by em
 barking on a journey that begins in 1753 and concludes in 1943. Attendees 
 will enjoy listening to the sounds of the season\; and participating in ha
 nds-on activities that are fun for all ages. Admission is FREE!
GEO:36.15468;-80.296177
LOCATION:Historic Bethabara Park
SUMMARY:Four Christmases at Bethabara
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/four-christmases-at-bethabar
