DESCRIPTION:Join us as we look at Christmas traditions during the colonial 
 period in the Palmer Marsh House and into the early Victorian period in th
 e Bonner House. Christmas décor of the time periods\, vignettes\, live mu
 sic\, and light refreshments. \n\nUse of Palmer-Marsh\, Palmer Marsh yard\
 , Bonner House and Kitchen
GEO:35.476994;-76.811651
LOCATION:Historic Bath
