DESCRIPTION:We cordially invite you to see Aycock Birthplace in a new light
 . Tour our historic buildings with costumed interpreters by candlelight an
 d watch the preparation of a Christmas meal on a hearth all while learning
  about historical Christmas and New Years traditions. Admission is $5.00 (
 plus tax)\, admission is free for visitors aged 12 and under.\nMore inform
 ation and details to be announced as the event approaches.
GEO:35.520185;-77.976051
